[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975072377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103175#issuecomment-2975072377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103175","id":2975072377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xVAB5","user":{"login":"PurpBatBoi","id":97393974,"node_id":"U_kgDOBc4dNg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97393974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi","html_url":"https://github.com/PurpBatBoi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T04:33:45Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T04:33:45Z","body":"any work arounds for this?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975072377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995840843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103175#issuecomment-2995840843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103175","id":2995840843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ykOdL","user":{"login":"machinescreen","id":132695269,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-jE5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132695269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen","html_url":"https://github.com/machinescreen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T10:21:16Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T10:23:38Z","body":"> any work arounds for this?\r\n\r\nYes. Just add the following code to the vertex function of a spatial shader:\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nif (OUTPUT_IS_SRGB) {\r\n\t\tCOLOR.rgb = mix(\r\n\t\t\t\t(pow(COLOR.rgb, vec3(1.0 / 2.4)) * (1.0 + 0.055)) - vec3(0.055),\r\n\t\t\t\tCOLOR.rgb * 12.92,\r\n\t\t\t\tlessThan(COLOR.rgb, vec3(0.0031308)));\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that that you don't need the `if (OUTPUT_IS_SRGB)` statement if you're definitely sticking with Compatibility for a project and aren't ever going to switch between renderers.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995840843/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2998472821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103175#issuecomment-2998472821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103175","id":2998472821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yuRB1","user":{"login":"PurpBatBoi","id":97393974,"node_id":"U_kgDOBc4dNg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97393974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi","html_url":"https://github.com/PurpBatBoi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PurpBatBoi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T01:32:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T01:32:23Z","body":"> > any work arounds for this?\r\n> \r\n> Yes. Just add the following code to the vertex function of a spatial shader:\r\n> \r\n> ```glsl\r\n> if (OUTPUT_IS_SRGB) {\r\n> \t\tCOLOR.rgb = mix(\r\n> \t\t\t\t(pow(COLOR.rgb, vec3(1.0 / 2.4)) * (1.0 + 0.055)) - vec3(0.055),\r\n> \t\t\t\tCOLOR.rgb * 12.92,\r\n> \t\t\t\tlessThan(COLOR.rgb, vec3(0.0031308)));\r\n> }\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> Note that that you don't need the `if (OUTPUT_IS_SRGB)` statement if you're definitely sticking with Compatibility for a project and aren't ever going to switch between renderers.\r\n\r\nPerfect! and tbh might not switch renderers because vertex lighting on forward is bit buggy ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2998472821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]